<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index closed at 543.95, up 0.59.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 252 to 245.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.01.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 21,763,620 compared with 23,504,480 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EST/2130 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
